Objetivo General

Transform Phase 10 from a Mission Control demonstration into a complete end-to-end operational simulation that reproduces the full agricultural workflow without requiring physical hardware.

Phase 10D completes the demonstration platform.

It does not introduce production autonomy, hardware integration, or commercial infrastructure.

Those remain part of Phase 11 and beyond.

